<title>USA: Optical Data names Timothy Kinnear CFO.</title>
<headline>Optical Data names Timothy Kinnear CFO.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Optical Data Systems Inc said Tuesday it had named Timothy Kinnear as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Kinnear, who will assume post September 16, replaces Roger Hughes who resigned, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
